---

This product includes design patterns informed by TensorZero (Apache 2.0).
Provider adapter patterns (request forwarding, SSE streaming relay, token
counting logic, error handling) draw from TensorZero's approach. Because
kyrisd uses native-format passthrough rather than TensorZero's normalization
approach, the code is structurally different — not a direct port.

TensorZero: https://github.com/tensorzero/tensorzero
